gine/godot/pull/123408\r\n\r\nThis fixes a bug where shadows were applied to indirect specular lighting when using vertex shading. \r\n\r\nThis results in losing all specular information in shadows.\r\n\r\n_Before: Vertex shading on_\r\n_Note the lack of shading on the character and how bright the metallic highlights on the wall are in the sun_\r\n<img width=\"1989\" height=\"1195\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-09-14 14-24-55\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abf5e155-1a04-45a6-83e1-efccf936227f\" />\r\n\r\n_After: Vertex shading on_\r\n_Note the specular highlights on the character and the wall is much closer to what it should be_\r\n<img width=\"1989\" height=\"1195\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-09-14 15-46-14\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/869cb12b-066e-4aea-9211-5980f8eb4acf\" />\r\n\r\n_Both: Vertex shading off_\r\n<img width=\"1989\" height=\"1195\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-09-14 14-25-14\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b743939d-369d-4460-ad78-1f9b3a7cd3eb\" />\r\n\r\nThere are a few other issues I noticed while making this PR that I can fix in the followup","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":11568492,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AsIVs","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/21","html_url":"https://github.co